<h1>Visiting the workshop</h1>

<p>
  Bring your bicycle to Wheelhouse for an initial inspection. We will explain
  the recommended work and confirm the price before beginning.
</p>

<h2>Location</h2>

<p>
  Avenida Monseñor Álvaro del Portillo 12455, Las Condes
</p>

<h2>Opening hours</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Monday to Friday: 09:00–18:00</li>
  <li>Saturday: 10:00–14:00</li>
  <li>Sunday: Closed</li>
</ul>

<h2>What happens when you arrive?</h2>

<ol>
  <li>Bring your bicycle to the workshop.</li>
  <li>We inspect it and discuss the available options.</li>
  <li>You approve the service and its price.</li>
  <li>We tell you when the bicycle will be ready.</li>
</ol>